# Plan: app-admin IaC, Back-End Implementation & Test Suite

## Overview

Three-part plan:

1. **IaC** — provision a second Azure Static Web App for `app-admin` using the same Bicep/azd pattern as `app`
2. **Back-End** — page-by-page replacement of all mocked data in `app-admin` with real calls to DAB GraphQL and Azure Functions; plus a seeded demo admin user
3. **Tests** — a dedicated Azure-hosted Playwright test suite in `tests/specs/admin/`

