## Decisions & Exclusions

- **Auth mechanism**: Same custom email+password flow as `app` (DAB GraphQL lookup + `/api/password/verify`), gated to `PersonType = 'EM'`. Full Entra ID SSO is out of scope for this demo.
- **Demo credential seeding**: Fixed-salt PBKDF2 hash computed in PowerShell inside the seed job — idempotent, self-contained, no external service dependency.
- **Live currency rates**: `open.er-api.com` call kept as-is (real external API, not mock data).
- **`swa-app.bicep` unchanged**: New `swa-app-admin.bicep` created rather than modifying existing module, to avoid any risk of breaking the existing `app` deployment.
- **Test config isolation**: Separate `playwright.admin.config.ts` so existing test runs are completely unaffected.
- **Voice Sales Assistant**: Out of scope — requires Speech Services SDK integration beyond the current Functions surface.

